# The base AI drives the route; this does not qualify a playable release.
# This private probe enters a solo Rally stage through a generic activity,
# using the current car, then continues through the base results. The entry borrows
# the Media Center prompt and base race UI until real Rally UI is implemented.
# It tests the first-stage finish; official Rally progression remains open.
